hree great feature films (every Tuesday has a different theme), and the best bartender ever, Wheels, on staff. Check it out - it's a little out of the way, but that makes parking easy, and also makes it a great place to 'take over' with your friends, for an impromptu birthday party or sports ..."},{"business_id":"ZW5RwyoMuAjXsAsrHxMv3w","review_id":"Nq2EyPf0WgJpQfLPKQ_9IQ","date":"2014-08-21T01:44:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9162869453430176,"text_excerpt":"Definitely a cool dive bar. My dad told me about it since they have a Wednesday $10 steak night with $1 PBRs and it's a good deal. Food's a bit salty, but still good. Bartender Emma was great :) definitely will be back!"},{"business_id":"ZW5RwyoMuAjXsAsrHxMv3w","review_id":"Vr86XBwQvAf-zhmsP4XEOw","date":"2015-01-10T16:34:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9133456349372864,"text_excerpt":"Awesome dive bar withe plenty of cheap drinks and pretty good bar food. No, they don't have J'Anitas anymore, but they have everything from burgers to po-boys to wraps, with all kinds of (usually fried) sides. They had about 8 beers on tap, including $2 PBRs and the new NOLA Muses brew. They also had the 40 Arpent milk stout that everyone is raving about, but like every other establishment it had just run out :( There is also plenty for entertainment, such as darts, shuffle board, etc. On Friday there was karaoke with an welcoming mix of talent ranging from \"wow, you could have a local band\" to \"someone tell the cats outside to stop breeding\". The bartenders and other patrons all seemed v..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ZW5RwyoMuAjXsAsrHxMv3w","photo_id":"OtBVPuHIGYFEsakDEbqkkQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/OtBVPuHIGYFEsakDEbqkkQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9482423067092896},{"business_id":"ZW5RwyoMuAjXsAsrHxMv3w","photo_id":"jss_g2-NDvxNWDTyvDHEZg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/jss_g2-NDvxNWDTyvDHEZg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9251641035079956},{"business_id":"ZW5RwyoMuAj